# 3dfx OpenGL ICD -- what stays out of the repository.
#
# Tracked: src/ (including the vendored Glide SDK and its glide3x.lib), build/makefile.vc6, build/3dfxogl.def,
# build/3dfxogl.rc, tools/, toolchain/*/README.txt, README.md.

# ---- private working notes (kept on disk, not in the repository)
RE-NOTES.md

# ---- build output (tools/vc6build.sh writes everything into build/out)
build/out/
build/*.pdb
*.obj
*.res
*.exp
*.ilk
*.map
*.idb
*.pch

# ---- Microsoft binaries: the VC6 RTM and VC 4.2 compilers and the Win32 import libraries.  Kept on disk for the
# standalone build, out of the repository because they are not ours to redistribute.  For a private repository that
# should build from a fresh clone, delete these three lines.
toolchain/vc6rtm/Bin/
toolchain/vc42/Bin/
toolchain/lib/**/*.LIB

# ---- reference sources (SGI OpenGL Sample Implementation; ref/3dfx-opengl links outside the project)
ref/

# ---- DLLs anywhere (the original 3dfxOGL.dll, copies of our builds)
*.dll
*.DLL

# ---- Python / editor leftovers
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
